  data: {
    LLM: "Only bluff when you have no choice or when you hold very few cards of the current rank. Use your real cards first to thin your hand.\n\nRank Tracking: Count how many cards of the current rank have been played. If you hold three Kings and someone else plays two, you know they are lying.\n\nThe Desperation Bluff: If you are down to your last card and it doesn't match the rank, you MUST bluff. Try to play it quickly and confidently to deter challenges.",
    Player: "Only bluff when you have no choice or when you hold very few cards of the current rank. Use your real cards first to thin your hand.\n\nRank Tracking: Count how many cards of the current rank have been played. If you hold three Kings and someone else plays two, you know they are lying.\n\nThe Desperation Bluff: If you are down to your last card and it doesn't match the rank, you MUST bluff. Try to play it quickly and confidently to deter challenges.",
